{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u231bCORE MECHANICS\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bImprint System\u200b</strong>\u200b: Use a &quot;Chronocamera&quot; (Imprint Sphere) to \u200b<strong>\u200brecord/rewind\u200b</strong>\u200b objects' states (position, switches, motion) and crack mind-bending puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bMechanic Analogy\u200b</strong>\u200b: Think of it as a \u200b<strong>\u200btemporal camera\u200b</strong>\u200b:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bSnapshot (Imprint)\u200b</strong>\u200b: Target objects (doors, lasers, machinery) to save their current state (position, rotation, activation, etc.).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bReview (Rewind)\u200b</strong>\u200b: Reload &quot;temporal snapshots&quot; to undo mistakes or forge new paths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bDynamic State Chains\u200b</strong>\u200b: Manipulate multi-object synergies (e.g., &quot;1-switch controls 2 gates&quot;) and predict \u200b<strong>\u200bchain reactions\u200b</strong>\u200b. <br>\u200b<strong>\u200bNegation Rules\u200b</strong>\u200b: Rewinding a &quot;recorded ON state&quot; after disabling its controller triggers \u200b<strong>\u200blogic inversion</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The demo version includes the first 4 levels.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3782440?t=1749010407","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782440/1749b12b818f721ae76793b79510a679b4f32b67/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749010407","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782440/1919e8f14939f1fa0f76f9c53620efea927ee107/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749010407","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782440/1919e8f14939f1fa0f76f9c53620efea927ee107/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749010407","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u231bCORE MECHANICS\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bImprint System\u200b</strong>\u200b: Use a &quot;Chronocamera&quot; (Imprint Sphere) to \u200b<strong>\u200brecord/rewind\u200b</strong>\u200b objects' states (position, switches, motion) and crack mind-bending puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bMechanic Analogy\u200b</strong>\u200b: Think of it as a \u200b<strong>\u200btemporal camera\u200b</strong>\u200b:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bSnapshot (Imprint)\u200b</strong>\u200b: Target objects (doors, lasers, machinery) to save their current state (position, rotation, activation, etc.).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bReview (Rewind)\u200b</strong>\u200b: Reload &quot;temporal snapshots&quot; to undo mistakes or forge new paths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bDynamic State Chains\u200b</strong>\u200b: Manipulate multi-object synergies (e.g., &quot;1-switch controls 2 gates&quot;) and predict \u200b<strong>\u200bchain reactions\u200b</strong>\u200b. <br>\u200b<strong>\u200bNegation Rules\u200b</strong>\u200b: Rewinding a &quot;recorded ON state&quot; after disabling its controller triggers \u200b<strong>\u200blogic inversion</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The demo version includes the first 4 levels.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["CelestialArk"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3678770","name":"Void Protocol"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_